      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `f739e517887e863b5eaf5426aaee0612fe851ddfc801a22b940542ae987b569f--summary-tables-1-to-3a-.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Crime Victimisation, Australia (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2016-17\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 8 of 8\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | 9edc7ae8f93553612a268c38bd0182be178ab6768e2beed4764af5139efc69a3 | missing |\n| \"Table 1\" | e9d99f64138933df3489a233a4858fee4566bc12e4d8b6a8b9134519f2b7ba7a | missing |\n| \"Table 1a\" | 8ef8fa9b34c44b72cbc3dbbae6323647b0c6380714c874ea09b1fce0afb13920 | missing |\n| \"Table 2\" | 9c432a147b598669ab6c25ad629fcb4716d68b00b008cd9538c06ac06d0bdd8b | missing |\n| \"Table 2a\" | 4631632a0e5e18a1b9182612dc583d418d14337d7fcd64dfa31b6af813ec943c | missing |\n| \"Table 3\" | f48673eddf0e725d439ee8d367ea342f475bc448f89b7c33e760c75fe2c667b4 | missing |\n| \"Table 3a\" | 568b52f16f08bf9c3e9e489e99e06e66704d9c0cdbac515c2e38f8d2dd0c3ed3 | missing |\n| \"Explanatory Notes\" | efe15ac30aa7fc7f694b0e3367fc47472e578cbcb14ec94be03a96d6c2b3ca59 | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
